{"id":679,"root":"ندم","bw":"ndm","tr":"n-d-m","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَدِمَ عَلَى مَا فَعَلَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>He grieved for what he had done; regretted it; repented of it:</em> or <em>he disliked it.</em> (Msb.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَدِيمٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>A companion in drinking; a cup-companion.</em> (S, Msb, K.) And hence, <em>Any convivial companion; a boon-companion.</em> </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَنْدَمٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>Repentance:</em> an inf. n. of <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَدِمَ</span>; see an ex. in a verse of El-Kattál El-Kilábee, cited voce <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَىٌّ</span>. </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":772,"entries":3,"shownEntries":3,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"ndm"}